Note, Database example with SQLite.

Open a database called school.
Create a table called students with columns name and grade.

Insert into students the values Alice and 1.
Insert into students the values Bob and 2.
Insert into students the values Charlie and 1.

Say All students.
Select from students and store in all.
For each student in all,
    Say the entry name in student.
End for each.

Say Grade 1 students.
Select from students where grade is equal to 1 and store in grade one.
Say the length of grade one.

Update students set grade to 2 where name is equal to Alice.
Delete from students where name is equal to Charlie.

Select from students and store in remaining.
Say Remaining students.
Say the length of remaining.

Close the database.
